        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions SD-PCF08-LTBL, Pacific Blue Acrylic Glass Shower Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe First Impressions Blue Acrylic Shower Door Pull is available in two colors: blue--which is a deep cobalt blue--or ocean blue--which is lighter (see picture below). It is made out of high quality, 1 inch thick acrylic. Comes packaged with back-to-back mounting for a glass shower door. Choose from 12 or 24 inch lengths.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-SGA-colors.jpg?v=1704442265\" width=\"600\" height=\"109\" border=\"0\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching <a href=\"/products/blue-door-pull-first-impressions-pcf08-ltbl\"><b>Blue Sliding Glass Door Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Acrylic Pacific Blue Shower Door Pull:\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" align=\"right\" border=\"0\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Grip Material: Acrylic</li>\r\n<li>Bracket Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Door Mounting: 1/4\" to 1/2\" thick glass doors.</li>\r\n<li>Door pull includes installation hardware.</li>\r\n<li>Door pulls are hand waxed with butchers wax to add longevity to the life of the finish.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>FII-PCF08012-LTBL:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>FII-PCF08024-LTBL:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Packaged with 2 door pulls, 4 rosettes plus mounting hardware for back to back mounting on 1/4\" to 1/2\" thick glass shower doors.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Blue Acrylic Shower Door Pull",
                "description": "FII-Pacific, First Impressions Blue Acrylic Shower Door Pulls - The First Impressions Blue Acrylic Shower Door Pull is available in two colors: blue--which is a deep cobalt blue--or ocean blue--which is lighter (see picture below). It is made out of high quality, 1 inch thick acrylic. Comes packaged with back-to-back mounting for a glass shower door. Choose from 18 or 24 inch lengths.",
